WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We don't always
have enough time to cover

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:04.604 size:84% position:42%
all of the recent news,
so here with a recap

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
is one of our writers,
Amber Ruffin,

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:09.275 size:75% position:38%
in a segment we call
"Amber Says What."

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.411 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:11.878 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hey!

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:14.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
You guys,
things have been crazy.

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:15.682 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Okay, first of all,

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:18.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
Prince William and Kate
had a baby boy.

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:20.353 line:92%
And everyone was like, "Whaat?"

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:23.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then Kendrick Lamar
became the first rapper ever

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
to win a Pulitzer Prize
for music.

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:27.160 line:92%
And I was like, "Whaat?!"

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.597 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then trump's lawyer was like,
"I have a secret client."

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:32.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "What?"
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:35.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then, he was like,
"It's Sean Hannity!"

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.070 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And I was like, "What?!"

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then they showed
a picture of Sean Hannity,

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:42.542 line:92%
and I was like, "Whaat...

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:43.343 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
happened to him?"

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:47.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did he get stung in the neck
by a thousand bees?

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:50.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then Starbucks called
the police on two black men

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:51.351 size:84% position:42% line:92%
for just sitting there.

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:54.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I heard that and was like,
"Whaaaat?"

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:56.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then everyone was like,
"We are mad!"

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:57.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Starbucks was like,
"We sorry."

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then everyone was like,
"We are still mad."

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:01.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Starbucks was like,
"We sorry?"

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then everyone was like,
"We stay mad."

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:05.598 size:84% position:42%
And Starbucks was like,
"We will close 8,000

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:08.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
U.S. stores May 29th
for racial bias training."

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:11.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
And everyone was like,
"...Okay."

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:12.906 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:16.142 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then a white boxer
wearing shorts that said

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:17.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
"America First"
and had a picture

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:22.182
of a border wall on them
went up against a Mexican boxer

00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:23.783 line:92%
and I was like, "Whaaat?"

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:24.918 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:27.420 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Then that Mexican boxer

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.456 size:88% position:44% line:92%
whooped that man so bad.

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:31.691 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I was like, "[ Laughs ]"

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:34.928 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:38.131 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Que?

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:40.133 line:92%
Then, the cutest thing happened.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.836 align:start size:94% position:6%
A Golden Retriever service dog
got to march

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:45.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
for its owner's
commencement graduation!

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:48.174 line:92%
And it wore a cap and gown.

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:52.712 align:start size:94% position:6%
And when it got to the stage,
the Dean shook its paw.

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:55.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
I saw that and was like,
"Woof?!"

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:56.950 line:92%
Which is dog for "What?!"

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:57.484 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.484 --> 00:02:01.121
Then I found out Trump didn't go
to Barbara Bush's funeral,

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:04.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
