"What...a good idea."

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:09.462
But Melania went and she had
the best time with Barack.

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:11.197 align:start size:94% position:6%
They were laughing
and carrying on.

00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:14.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "Melania,
what...is that on your face?

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:16.503 line:92%
I have never seen that before."

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:17.237 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:20.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then I heard Beyoncé was going
to perform at Coachella.

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:24.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"What is Coachella?"

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:26.546 size:81% position:41%
Then someone explained
that it's a festival

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:30.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
