and I was like, "What?

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.718 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That sounds white."

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:32.585 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.585 --> 00:02:35.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
