"You can watch it online!"

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:38.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I did, and Beyoncé came out
looking like

00:02:38.024 --> 00:02:41.027 line:92%
literal black r-roy-alty.

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:42.428 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:46.232
She came out looking like
literal black royalty.

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:49.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
Say it three times fast.
You can't.

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:49.736 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:52.338
She came out looking good
is what I'm trying to say,

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:53.006 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and I was like, "What?!"

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:56.409
Then she was all like,
"Coachella, where are all

00:02:56.409 --> 00:02:59.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
