00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:07.720
And she had a huge black college
marching band,

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:08.655 line:92%
and I was like, "Whaat?!"

00:03:08.655 --> 00:03:10.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then she sang hit
after hit after hit.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:13.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like "what"
after "what" after "what."

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:16.729 size:75% position:38%
Then she brought out
her sister Solange,

00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:18.431 size:84% position:42% line:92%
